<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea First Bank says gets no bids for Hanbo Steel.</title>
<headline>Korea First Bank says gets no bids for Hanbo Steel.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>An auction to sell off failed Hanbo Steel Co was unsuccessful because no bids were received by the 0600 GMT Tuesday deadline, Hanbo's main creditor Korea First Bank said.</p>
</text>
